The first three files above are no longer used by the game: they were
replaced by Stable Audio Open generated sounds (catalog groups
vehicle.door_open, pedestrian.curse, ambient.city_day; see
docs/audio/stable-audio-replacements.json) and moved to legacy/, kept until
the replacements have passed a listening review.
